# Frontend — root (`@nucleify/root`)

Landing Nuxt app. Source in `root/src/`. Shared code comes from `shared_modules/`.

## Structure

```
root/src/
├── pages/[lang]/     # Thin route wrappers
├── pages/home/       # Landing sections (migrated from nuc_pages)
├── plugins/          # nucleify-ui + registerNuc*
├── server/api/       # Nitro gateway catch-all
├── assets/           # SCSS entry (imports from shared_modules)
└── nucleify.ts       # Re-exports shared_modules + flashToast
```

## Conventions

- UI: `nui-*` from `nucleify-ui` (Lit web components)
- Vue SFCs: `<script setup lang="ts">`
- Import shared via `shared_modules/nuc_*/…` or `modules` alias
- Do not place shared code under `root/`
